{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the impact of using the imagenet_vit_l image encoder with the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multiprofile multimodal setup, using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.7150 and F1 of 0.6872 suggest the image encoder choice may contribute to performance improvements compared to previous baselines (e.g., 0.6315 accuracy in llm_summary_007). However, the role of other factors like aggregation or fusion strategies remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative configurations."
}

